Hungry Birds. You are a bird that is always getting hungrier: your health drains on a timer, and you die when it empties. Eating a worm (food) restores health; a food pile (foodbank) restores health AND scores +40. Reaching the green exit door wins the game (+100).

Tactic: never linger — starvation is the clock. Follow the trail of worms toward the exit, eating as you go; detour to food piles for the +40, then push on to the green door before your health runs out.

